%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 09d9dd0205bab0640872e2256248d999, type: 3}
  m_Name: M1 Battle Tutorial 2 - Ordering Troops
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _source: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 97850cd62848de54cb28d14606b6b28f, type: 3}
  _sourcePath: Assets/Leveraged Wars Story/2. Missions/M1-Tutorial/M1 Battle Tutorial
    2 - Ordering Troops.md
  _warnings: []
  _lines:
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: The horn has sounded, my prince. Now you tell us what to do, and we shall
      do it. Mostly.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: 
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Pause the battle first, so you can think while I talk.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: 
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: I am paused. How do I take hold of a troop?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Click it. Its card appears. Click one of mine twice and you take the whole
      chain of us. Drag a box round several if you prefer.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: And to make them walk?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Press on the troop and drag to where you want them. That is a plain Move.
      We walk there and plan nothing clever on the way.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: I would like a proper line.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Right button, and drag. Where you press to where you let go is our front.
      Drag it long and we stand wide and thin. Drag it short and we stand narrow
      and deep.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: The direction of the drag is the way we face.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Can several troops stand in one line?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Choose several, then drag. We stand shoulder to shoulder, and where our
      ends meet we link into a chain. A chain holds better than strangers do.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Hold Alt and we leave gaps and do not link.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: And to attack?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Right-click the enemy troop. A red path means we are going to hit them,
      not walk past them. We shall pursue until it is finished, so choose your fight.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: What if I only wish them to turn?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Hold Control and right-click. We shall face that way where we stand. Use
      it before the enemy reaches us, not after.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: One more thing. A line wheels round. We do not spin on the spot, and we
      walk forward. Send us a long way sideways and we shall turn first and walk
      after.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Will they always obey?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Not if they have broken. A troop that is falling back, scattered or running
      will not hear you. Which is the lesson after this one.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
